  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IFAD Support to programs on nutrition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support 7-10 agricultural development projects supported from IFAD core funding under IFAD11 - with the goal to increase the nutrtion sensitivity of the projects. The project is in line with the Noregian action plan for sustainable food systems in the foriegn and development policy 2019-2023. Countries involved are Benin, Burkina Faso, Malawi, SaoTome and Principe, Sudan and Zimbabwe.</narrative>
  </description>
